Error: Jet.UnusedPlaceMark: `^^` marks a whole name, not a field of `st`
  --> Tests/UI/E0228_take_mark_explains_take.jet:17:10
    |
 17 |     seal(^^st.buf)
    |          ^^
 Why: `seal: fn(xs: ^^[Int])` takes this input, and a field moves out with `.move()`, not a leading `^^`
 Fix: Write `.move()` on the field instead of `^^`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/Jet.UnusedPlaceMark

Error: Jet.UnusedPlaceMark: `n` is a copied type, so `take_n` takes no `^^`
  --> Tests/UI/E0228_take_mark_explains_take.jet:19:12
    |
 19 |     take_n(^^n)
    |            ^^
 Why: `take_n: fn(n: ^^Int)` takes this input by value, which copies `n` instead of moving it, so `n` stays usable after the call
 Fix: Remove the `^^`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/Jet.UnusedPlaceMark
